Rage of Mages — J2ME recovery, transliteration, and native Rust port.

This repository contains only recovered-by-hand reconstruction (code, transcribed
data, provenance ledgers) and our own additions. It is dedicated to the public
domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal dedication.

To the extent possible under law, the authors have waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to the contents of this repository. See the full
CC0 1.0 legalcode at: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

This repository is deliberately RESOURCE-FREE: it never contains literal copied
binaries from the original game. The surviving distributions and other copied
bytes live in a private resources location and are materialized into git-ignored
paths by the fetch tool. Those original works remain the property of their
respective rights holders and are NOT covered by this dedication.
